#: ../../INSTALL.md:31 f7226984ddf740d58b1d1823ec3e29ec
msgid ""
"Protobuf is found with `find_package(Protobuf CONFIG REQUIRED)`. The "
"CONFIG mode is deliberate — the deprecated `FindProtobuf` module misses "
"the abseil dependencies that libprotobuf now carries. A protobuf "
"installed without its CMake package config will not work."
msgstr "Protobuf 是以 `find_package(Protobuf CONFIG REQUIRED)` 尋找的。使用 CONFIG 模式是刻意的——已棄用的 `FindProtobuf` 模組會漏掉 libprotobuf 現在帶有的 abseil 相依套件。安裝時沒有附帶 CMake package config 的 protobuf 無法使用。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:36 087ac4760caa48c2a1a38957a88e43ee
msgid ""
"Vendoring QuantLib does **not** make the build self-contained: Boost is "
"an external dependency on both routes."
msgstr "內附 QuantLib **並不會**讓建置自給自足：在兩條路線上，Boost 都是外部相依套件。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:39 760003fc42a04abc9473f84373431f06
msgid "Route A (Recommended) — build QuantLib from the submodule"
msgstr "路線 A（建議）——從子模組建置 QuantLib"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:49 3d33d02b91f8430f9ca2f169ce763e6a
msgid ""
"`CMakeLists.txt` forces `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS=ON` and "
"`QL_ENABLE_OPENMP=OFF` before adding QuantLib's directory, so the two "
"settings this service cannot be correct without are build settings rather"
" than properties of somebody's install tree. That is the whole reason "
"this route exists — see [Why sessions matter](#why-sessions-matter)."
msgstr "`CMakeLists.txt` 在加入 QuantLib 的目錄之前，強制設定 `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS=ON` 與 `QL_ENABLE_OPENMP=OFF`，讓這個服務缺少了就不可能正確的兩項設定成為建置設定，而不是某人安裝目錄樹的屬性。這就是這條路線存在的全部理由——見[為什麼工作階段很重要](#why-sessions-matter)。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:55 38d6472e98d643fab16fe9eef4bb846f
msgid "Three notes:"
msgstr "三點說明："

#: ../../INSTALL.md:57 e49a3de4ce8d4556b4ece1e2ddf0cae5
msgid ""
"`-Wno-dev` suppresses one warning, and it is QuantLib's rather than this "
"project's: `CMP0167`, the removal of CMake's `FindBoost` module, raised "
"at `third_party/QuantLib/CMakeLists.txt:164`. It is a policy a parent "
"project cannot set on a submodule's behalf. Drop the flag to see it; "
"nothing else is hidden, and Route B configures clean with or without it."
msgstr "`-Wno-dev` 抑制了一個警告，而且它屬於 QuantLib 而非本專案：`CMP0167`，也就是 CMake 移除 `FindBoost` 模組一事，發生在 `third_party/QuantLib/CMakeLists.txt:164`。這是上層專案無法代替子模組設定的 policy。拿掉這個旗標就能看到它；除此之外沒有隱藏任何東西，而路線 B 不論有沒有這個旗標，設定都乾淨無警告。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:62 5cec2450b8ae4bcca26e18af567857cf
msgid ""
"The second command is separate because the QuantLib submodule is marked "
"`update = none` in `.gitmodules`. A plain `--init --recursive` skips it, "
"so nobody on Route B pays for an 800 MB clone they will not use. "
"`--checkout` is what overrides that."
msgstr "第二個指令之所以分開，是因為 QuantLib 子模組在 `.gitmodules` 中標記為 `update = none`。單純的 `--init --recursive` 會略過它，所以走路線 B 的人不必為一份用不到的 800 MB clone 付出代價。`--checkout` 就是用來覆寫這項設定的。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:66 40c23663f67241799b67bb864d26324b
msgid ""
"QuantLib's full history is around 800 MB. Adding `--depth 1` to the "
"second command fetches the pinned commit alone and brings that down to "
"about 50 MB — 41 MB of working tree, 11 MB of git data:"
msgstr "QuantLib 的完整歷史約 800 MB。在第二個指令加上 `--depth 1`，就只會抓取固定的那個 commit，把大小降到約 50 MB——工作目錄 41 MB，git 資料 11 MB："

#: ../../INSTALL.md:74 117012cba4ee4240ad4f8ad91215e444
msgid ""
"This works because the pin is a release tag rather than an arbitrary "
"commit — git fetches it by SHA and checks it out directly. Nothing in the"
" build needs the history."
msgstr "這之所以可行，是因為固定的是一個發行標籤，而不是任意的 commit——git 會依 SHA 抓取並直接 checkout。建置中沒有任何東西需要歷史紀錄。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:78 36be9f25e1f34598985fd4d78581db97
msgid ""
"Expect the first build to take a while — QuantLib is ~1000 translation "
"units and all of them are new."
msgstr "第一次建置預期要花上一段時間——QuantLib 約有 1000 個編譯單元，而且全部都是新的。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:81 3b68a941354e45df85c46bcec4bb4a16
msgid "Route B — link an installed QuantLib"
msgstr "路線 B——連結已安裝的 QuantLib"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:90 441c984257854039a37bf808cadcd893
msgid ""
"`CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` must name a QuantLib **built with "
"`QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS`**. Nothing in this build checks that, and the "
"failure is silent — see below. If you do not already have one:"
msgstr "`CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` 必須指向一份**以 `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` 建置**的 QuantLib。這個建置中沒有任何東西會檢查這一點，而且失敗是靜默的——見下文。如果你手邊還沒有："

#: ../../INSTALL.md:106 bfcf9142520943fd807d9472979bf378
msgid ""
"Install it to a **prefix of its own**, not over a general-purpose "
"QuantLib. `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` changes the behaviour of "
"`Singleton<T>::instance()` for every program that links the library, and "
"other projects will not expect it. Two prefixes side by side is the "
"intended arrangement:"
msgstr "把它安裝到**專屬的前綴**，而不要覆蓋在通用的 QuantLib 上。`QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` 會改變每個連結該函式庫的程式中 `Singleton<T>::instance()` 的行為，其他專案不會預期到這一點。兩個前綴並存才是預期的安排："

