#: ../../INSTALL.md:119 31460e9161044782b82d12c6be434157
msgid "Why sessions matter"
msgstr "為什麼工作階段很重要"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:121 9dffa8d4181844ddae2eb482e22cca0e
msgid ""
"`Singleton<T>::instance()` returns one process-wide static in a default "
"QuantLib, and a `thread_local` one under `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS`. "
"`Settings`, which holds `evaluationDate()`, is one of those singletons."
msgstr "在預設的 QuantLib 中，`Singleton<T>::instance()` 回傳一個整個行程共用的 static 物件；在 `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` 下則回傳一個 `thread_local` 物件。存放 `evaluationDate()` 的 `Settings` 就是這類 singleton 之一。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:125 f29c42cdd9f643e99cea56d8750a7499
msgid ""
"The wrong QuantLib therefore compiles, links, and prices a single session"
" perfectly correctly. It only goes wrong with two sessions in one "
"process, which then silently share one evaluation date — plausible "
"numbers, wrong date, no error anywhere. DESIGN §2 is the argument in "
"full."
msgstr "因此，錯誤的 QuantLib 照樣能編譯、連結，並完全正確地為單一工作階段定價。只有同一個行程裡有兩個工作階段時才會出錯，而它們會悄悄共用同一個評價日——數字看似合理、日期是錯的、任何地方都沒有錯誤。完整的論證見 DESIGN §2。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:130 c8326ab4a37445898ebe5a2e984c61d2
msgid ""
"`test/smoke_v2.py` is the check that catches it. Two of its sessions sit "
"on evaluation dates one day apart and must disagree by one day of theta; "
"**prices that agree exactly mean the wrong QuantLib is linked.**"
msgstr "`test/smoke_v2.py` 就是能抓出這個問題的檢查。它的兩個工作階段位在相差一天的評價日上，價格必須相差一天的 theta；**價格若完全一致，就表示連結了錯誤的 QuantLib。**"

