#: ../../INSTALL.md 734caf9da1dc4cc3a7bdef81d8b26944
msgid "`-Werror` on `qlservice`. The tree is warning-free on both routes"
msgstr "對 `qlservice` 啟用 `-Werror`。整個原始碼樹在兩條路線上都沒有警告"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:141 ea3819f1b89b4e2ebea8d6c5cc6db6b1
msgid ""
"Warnings are `-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Wno-switch`, and only on this "
"project's own targets: generated protobuf code and uSockets build with "
"`-w`, and a vendored QuantLib's headers are marked as system includes. "
"The `ql-backend` target drops `-Wpedantic` alone — uWebSockets' templates"
" are instantiated there and were not written to it — and "
"`QLSERVICE_WERROR` reaches `qlservice` only, so the three gateway "
"translation units are warned about but never fail on it."
msgstr "警告選項是 `-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Wno-switch`，而且只套用在本專案自己的建置目標上：產生的 protobuf 程式碼與 uSockets 以 `-w` 建置，內附 QuantLib 的標頭檔則標記為系統 include。`ql-backend` 目標只拿掉 `-Wpedantic`——uWebSockets 的樣板在那裡實體化，而它們並不是照這個標準寫的——而 `QLSERVICE_WERROR` 只作用於 `qlservice`，因此三個閘道編譯單元會收到警告，但從不會因此建置失敗。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:148 939dfa6c4006425fbb3198c2db7ba5d8
msgid "Things that will bite"
msgstr "容易踩到的坑"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:150 90057cc368ca45e5acbc44697a9d2b97
msgid ""
"**`QuantLib_DIR` is cached.** Changing `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` on an existing"
" build tree does not move an already-resolved QuantLib. Reconfigure with "
"`cmake --fresh` or delete the tree."
msgstr "**`QuantLib_DIR` 會被快取。** 在既有的建置目錄樹上變更 `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH`，並不會改變已經解析好的 QuantLib。請以 `cmake --fresh` 重新設定，或刪除該目錄樹。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:153 cc234a6cba8c4b08b985266e0dd7b8ab
msgid ""
"**An uninitialized `proto` is a hard error.** The schema is a submodule, "
"and `add_library()` names its `.proto` files directly, so a clone that "
"skips `git submodule update` fails the configure with `Cannot find source"
" file` rather than degrading. It is the one submodule with no graceful "
"path."
msgstr "**未初始化的 `proto` 是硬性錯誤。** 結構描述是一個子模組，而 `add_library()` 直接指名它的 `.proto` 檔，因此略過 `git submodule update` 的 clone 會在設定階段以 `Cannot find source file` 失敗，而不是降級運作。它是唯一沒有退路的子模組。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:157 8ade189004ea4c03b6d77df1da95831d
msgid ""
"**An uninitialized `third_party/uWebSockets` is not an error.** The "
"configure succeeds, `libqlservice.a` still builds, and only the `ql-"
"backend` executable is skipped — with a message telling you to init the "
"submodule. If you ran `cmake` before `git submodule update`, this is why "
"there is no binary."
msgstr "**未初始化的 `third_party/uWebSockets` 不是錯誤。** 設定會成功，`libqlservice.a` 照樣建置，只有 `ql-backend` 執行檔會被略過——並附上一則訊息要你初始化子模組。如果你在 `git submodule update` 之前就執行了 `cmake`，這就是沒有執行檔的原因。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:161 d51a27020dce40658096960dfd40f071
msgid ""
"**`--recursive` matters for uWebSockets**, which nests uSockets inside "
"itself. Without it uSockets is empty and the executable is skipped as "
"above."
msgstr "**`--recursive` 對 uWebSockets 很重要**，因為它在自己內部巢狀包含 uSockets。少了它，uSockets 會是空的，執行檔也會如上所述被略過。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:163 673d4c17c53944dd88c841aa9486a3f0
msgid ""
"**A browser is refused where a script is not.** An upgrade whose `Origin`"
" header is present and not on the allowed list is answered `403 "
"Forbidden` (DESIGN §9.6). The default list is the Vite dev server's ports"
" — `localhost` and `127.0.0.1` on 5173 and 4173 — so a frontend served "
"from anywhere else needs `--allow-origin URL`, and until it gets one the "
"failure looks exactly like a backend that is not running. A client that "
"sends no `Origin` at all, `test/smoke_v2.py` included, is unaffected. "
"`--help` lists that flag and the rest."
msgstr "**瀏覽器會被拒絕，腳本卻不會。** 帶有 `Origin` 標頭且不在允許清單上的升級請求，會得到 `403 Forbidden`（DESIGN §9.6）。預設清單是 Vite 開發伺服器的連接埠——`localhost` 與 `127.0.0.1` 上的 5173 與 4173——因此從其他任何地方提供的前端都需要 `--allow-origin URL`，而在設定好之前，這個失敗看起來和後端沒在執行一模一樣。完全不送 `Origin` 的客戶端，包括 `test/smoke_v2.py`，都不受影響。`--help` 會列出這個旗標與其餘旗標。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:171 9920167dae2b4e339cecfc53819b560c
msgid ""
"**A routable `--host` needs `--token-file FILE`.** Without one the daemon"
" refuses to start and exits 2, naming both ways out: give it a token "
"file, or leave it on loopback behind a proxy that terminates TLS and "
"authenticates. The check is a string comparison against the three "
"loopback spellings, so it is a rule you can act on rather than a lookup "
"you cannot see."
msgstr "**可路由的 `--host` 需要 `--token-file FILE`。** 少了它，常駐程式會拒絕啟動並以 2 結束，同時指出兩條出路：給它一個權杖檔，或讓它留在迴路位址上，放在一個終結 TLS 並負責驗證的代理之後。這項檢查是與三種迴路位址寫法做字串比對，因此它是一條你能據以行動的規則，而不是一次你看不見的查詢。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:176 661b4144778045788a20238ee6643205
msgid ""
"**`QLSERVICE_VENDOR_QUANTLIB=ON` with an empty submodule** stops the "
"configure with a `FATAL_ERROR` naming the checkout command. That one is "
"deliberate: a vendored build that silently fell back to `find_package` "
"would defeat the point of the option."
msgstr "**`QLSERVICE_VENDOR_QUANTLIB=ON` 搭配空的子模組**會以 `FATAL_ERROR` 中止設定，並指出該執行的 checkout 指令。這一項是刻意的：一個悄悄退回 `find_package` 的內附建置，會讓這個選項失去意義。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:181 8170692e8f554882bf305dafe2f228e2
msgid "Verifying the build"
msgstr "驗證建置"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:183 cc3239c1a5764c55a81b2e6bf804ae8e
msgid ""
"There is no unit-test target. `test/smoke_v2.py` drives a running `ql-"
"backend` over a real WebSocket; [the smoke tests page](TESTING.md) has "
"the setup and how to run it."
msgstr "沒有單元測試目標。`test/smoke_v2.py` 透過真正的 WebSocket 驅動一個執行中的 `ql-backend`；[冒煙測試頁面](TESTING.md)說明了準備步驟與執行方式。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:187 5f851021e4c94d9ab37080a45d4dc0a7
msgid ""
"Run it at least once after any change to which QuantLib you are linking. "
"Its two-session check is the only thing in the repository that "
"distinguishes a *wrong* QuantLib from a missing one."
msgstr "每當變更所連結的 QuantLib，之後至少執行它一次。它的雙工作階段檢查，是儲存庫中唯一能分辨*錯誤的* QuantLib 與缺少 QuantLib 的東西。"

#: ../../INSTALL.md:191 e3601da5cc2e4a7586c66946f4869ad8
msgid ""
"`GET /healthz` on the same port is the cheaper check either side of it: "
"it answers JSON carrying the QuantLib version the binary linked, its "
"uptime, and how many connections and sessions are open. It says which "
"QuantLib you got — not whether that one has sessions enabled, which is "
"what the paragraph above is for."
msgstr "同一連接埠上的 `GET /healthz` 是在它之前或之後都能做的較便宜檢查：它以 JSON 回應，內容包括執行檔所連結的 QuantLib 版本、已執行時間，以及目前開啟的連線數與工作階段數。它告訴你拿到的是哪一份 QuantLib——但不會告訴你那一份是否啟用了工作階段，那正是上一段的用途。"

